pected for recent works and is not a sign of low quality.","Mean versus median: the mean is above the median in 6 of 7 years, because a few highly cited works pull the average up. The widest gap is 2018: mean 1.1, median 0, top work 5. The median is the better guide to a typical work.","Recent years: works from 2024–2026 have had less than three years to be cited, so their values will rise.","Small base: the values for 2017–2026 are based on only 10–29 works (lighter box or hollow point), so read them with care."]}}}